OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order says says no
OL,4,Aproposals on table to resolve Drumcree
OL,5,Adispute
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe district master of the Orange Order
OL,8,Fin Portadown has said they were shown a
OL,9,Fdiscussion document in relation to the
OL,10,FDrumcree dispute, but stressed it was
OL,11,F"not a proposal".
OL,13,FBoth the Orange Order and the Garvaghy
OL,14,FRoad Residents' Coalition (GRRC) were
OL,15,Fgiven a document during separate
OL,16,Fmeetings with Secretary of State Sir
OL,17,FChris Bryant on Wednesday.
OL,19,FThe chairman of the residents'
OL,20,Fcoalition said his group would agree to
OL,21,Fit, if the Orange Order did.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
